  "details": "EDIT: I found out I had self-interactions off. So that made contacts and receivers not work. Turning it On fixed it.\n\nThis canny can be disregarded now.\n\nWhat I am showing you in this Canny post did work ingame a week ago and before.\n\nI am not sure what day exactly it stopped working, but yesterday (10/21/2023) it stopped working on all my previous uploads (one is from April 2023, id is avtr_8e0cd56e-c24f-49c0-8cf2-884d586490e3).\n\nI also tried to reupload one of the older uploads and test it in Unity and both ingame. \n\nSuch attempt is attached in this video: https://youtu.be/vM2pP04twoo\n\nAvatar ID : avtr_70111b38-0ade-4068-aec1-480b2b7c04f5\n\nThe summarisation of the information in the video is, that contacts and receivers in some of my avatars stopped working after upload.\n\nIn Unity everything works, and it worked before ingame.\n\nAlso a bone seems to be scaled up on it's own for some reason.\n\nI am attaching a screenshot of the hierarchy of this avatar + settings of the contacts and receivers.\n\nThis also happens on the current Open Beta.",
